<title>USA: General Instrument unit files suit.</title>
<headline>General Instrument unit files suit.</headline>
<dateline>ROHNERT PARK, Calif 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Instrument Corp's Next Level Communications unit said it is filing a patent infringement and antitrust suit against BroadBand Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>In the suit, filed in federal district court in San Francisco, Next Level claims BroadBand Technologies infringed on two U.S. patents held by General Instrument related to the transmission of digital video.</p>
<p>Next Level is asking for an injunction that prevents BroadBand Technologies from making, using or selling equipment that provides digital video signals.</p>
</text>
